:: Widget - nursery [widget]
/* The stat changes from a nursery encounter, one <<linkdesc>> line per NPC. Goes after the last Continue. See setup.nurseryEncounters.effectLines. */
<<widget nurseryEffects>>
	<<for _nurseryFxLine range setup.nurseryEncounters.effectLines()>>
		<<linkdesc>><<=_nurseryFxLine>><</linkdesc>>
	<</for>>
<</widget>>
